  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Central Hidroelctrica Porce II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hydroelectric Power Plant Porce II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HYDROELECTRIC PROJECT FORMS PART OF THE ELECTRIC POWER GENERATION PLAN THAT WILL ADD 392 MW AND AN ANNUAL AVERAGE PRODUCTION OF 1.980 GWH. PROJECT COMPONENTS ARE: 1) A WATER DAMM OF 118M. HIGH 2) UNDERGROUND POWER PLANT TO HOUSE 3 GENERATORS AND CORRESPONDING TRANSFORMERS; 3) INFRASTRUCTURE AND COMPLEMENTARY WORKS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
